{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}]}],"name":"docKey"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The serialized header."}]}],"name":"bytes"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"avoid – and it leaves the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"log","type":"text"}]},{"text":" alone too.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"serverSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":", so a restore reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the underlying storage raises.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","externalID":"s:6Yorkie14MemoryDocStoreC8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MemoryDocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" that keeps documents in memory for the lifetime of the process.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MemoryDocStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/MemoryDocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/memorydocstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"DocStore","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Yorkie","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"}}}